      "text": "1. The simple future"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The simple future is formed by adding the endings below to the <b>whole infinitive</b>. There is no stem change, and the endings are the same for -ar, -er and -ir verbs. Every form except nosotros has a written accent."
    },
