    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "2. Irregular stems"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "About a dozen common verbs change their stem. The endings stay the same, and the <b>same stems</b> are used for the conditional (section 4). Three types of change:"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "<b>The vowel drops:</b> poder, querer, saber, haber, caber: <i>podr-, querr-, sabr-, habr-, cabr-</i>",
        "<b>d replaces the vowel:</b> poner, salir, tener, venir: <i>pondr-, saldr-, tendr-, vendr-</i>",
        "<b>Shortened:</b> decir gives <i>dir-</i> and hacer gives <i>har-</i>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "conjgrid",
      "tense": "future",
      "verbs": [
