    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "tip",
      "title": "Reported speech uses the conditional",
      "text": "When the main verb is in the past, <i>he will come</i> becomes the conditional: <i>Dice que vendrá</i> (he says he will come) but <b>Dijo que vendría</b> (he said he would come)."
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
