      "title": "zou = would, not always",
      "text": "Dutch <i>zou</i> is both conditional (<i>ik zou gaan</i> = iría) and a polite form. In Spanish politeness often uses <b>quisiera</b> or <b>me gustaría</b> (<i>Quisiera un café</i>); the imperfect subjunctive is B2."
    },
